  "homeRental.reports.revenueFooterNote": { id: "Setiap kategori posting ke akun COA-nya sendiri (Home Rental — PS3/PS4/PS5/Playbox/TV/Accessory/Package/Delivery/Late Fee/Penggantian Kerusakan) — lihat Accounting > Chart of Accounts & Laba Rugi.", en: "Every category posts to its own COA account (Home Rental — PS3/PS4/PS5/Playbox/TV/Accessory/Package/Delivery/Late Fee/Damage Compensation) — see Accounting > Chart of Accounts & Income Statement.", ms: "Setiap kategori diposkan ke akaun COA sendiri (Sewa Rumah — PS3/PS4/PS5/Playbox/TV/Aksesori/Pakej/Penghantaran/Denda Lewat/Pampasan Kerosakan) — lihat Perakaunan > Carta Akaun & Penyata Untung Rugi.", th: "แต่ละหมวดหมู่จะโพสต์ไปยังบัญชี COA ของตัวเอง (Home Rental — PS3/PS4/PS5/Playbox/TV/Accessory/Package/Delivery/Late Fee/Penggantian Kerusakan) — ดูที่บัญชี > ผังบัญชี & งบกำไรขาดทุน", fil: "Bawat kategorya ay nagpo-post sa sariling COA account nito (Home Rental — PS3/PS4/PS5/Playbox/TV/Accessory/Package/Delivery/Late Fee/Damage Compensation) — tingnan ang Accounting > Chart of Accounts at Income Statement.", vi: "Mỗi hạng mục hạch toán vào tài khoản COA riêng (Cho thuê tại nhà — PS3/PS4/PS5/Playbox/TV/Phụ kiện/Gói/Giao hàng/Phí trễ/Bồi thường hư hỏng) — xem Kế toán > Hệ thống tài khoản & Báo cáo kết quả kinh doanh." },
